      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://cdn.motor1.com/images/mgl/OoZ2rY/s3/2026-zeekr-7gt-privilege.jpg\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 0.75em;padding:5px 10px;background:#f0f4f8;border-left:3px solid #7b9fc4;border-radius:3px;font-size:0.82em;color:#444;line-height:1.8;\">🪶 🏔️ 🔭 <a href=\"https://zirnhelt.github.io/super-rss-feed/review.html?url=https%3A%2F%2Finsideevs.com%2Fnews%2F810941%2Frussia-passes-america-ev-share%2F\" style=\"color:#7b9fc4;text-decoration:none;\">✏️</a></p>\nGasoline shortages are pushing Russian buyers toward electric cars and plug-in hybrids. Most of them come from China.",
      "date_published": "2026-10-06T16:47:23+00:00",
